Package: libqpoases3.2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: online active-set solver for convex quadratic programs
 qpOASES solves convex quadratic programs, and linear ones, with linear
 constraints and simple bounds by an online active-set strategy, which
 starts each solve from the solution of the previous one (hot start) and
 suits a sequence of problems close to each other; a singular Hessian is
 handled by regularization.
 .
 This package holds the shared library.

Package: libqpoases-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libqpoases3.2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: online active-set solver for convex QPs (development files)
 qpOASES solves convex quadratic programs, and linear ones, with linear
 constraints and simple bounds by an online active-set strategy, which
 starts each solve from the solution of the previous one (hot start) and
 suits a sequence of problems close to each other; a singular Hessian is
 handled by regularization.
 .
 This package holds the headers and the CMake configuration that
 find_package(qpOASES) finds.
